r.avif?t=1764235514\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D platforming with intense shoot 'em up combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique enemies and tough bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage cartoon visuals with a dark twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy. No shortcuts. Just roots, bullets, and skill</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist if you love cartoon art and hardcore challenge!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988980/extras/e5f5c638199e2ccf797b714860cee815.apng?t=1764235514\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988980/extras/e5f5c638199e2ccf797b714860cee815.poster.avif?t=1764235514\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Denis Davidov","Solvex Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988980/7430d5b7b11180a54ec676f78dde5022741e2a57/header.jpg?t=1764235514","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"